{"version": 2, "width": 100, "height": 34, "title": "Document Change Monitor \u2014 edited-paced replay of actual outputs", "env": {"TERM": "xterm-256color"}}
[0, "o", "\u001b[2J\u001b[HDocument Change Monitor\r\nWhat this project demonstrates\r\n\r\nA document update stores a new revision and replaces the current searchable text in one transaction. Search reads only active current versions; historical text stays in a separate revision table.\r\n"]
[10, "o", "\u001b[2J\u001b[HDocument Change Monitor\r\nActual fixture demo output\r\n\r\n{\r\n  \"mode\": \"fixture\",\r\n  \"python\": \"3.12.13\",\r\n  \"recorded_at\": \"2026-10-31T13:52:22.427313+00:00\",\r\n  \"elapsed_seconds\": 0.0133,\r\n  \"result\": {\r\n    \"diff\": {\r\n      \"changed\": true,\r\n      \"version\": 2,\r\n      \"diff\": \"--- policy:v1\\n+++ policy:v2\\n@@ -1 +1 @@\\n-Refund window: thirty days.\\n+Refund window: seven days.\"\r\n    },\r\n    \"current\": [\r\n      {\r\n        \"id\": \"policy\",\r\n        \"version\": 2,\r\n        \"text\": \"Refund window: seven days.\",\r\n        \"score\": 1\r\n      }\r\n    ],\r\n    \"old_term_results\": [],\r\n    \"after_retirement\": [],\r\n    \"history\": [\r\n      {\r\n        \"id\": \"policy:1\",\r\n        \"text\": \"Refund window: thirty days.\",\r\n        \"diff\": \"--- policy:v0\\n+++ policy:v1\\n@@ -0,0 +1 @@\\n+Refund window: thirty days.\"\r\n      },\r\n      {\r\n        \"id\": \"policy:2\",\r\n        \"text\": \"Refund window: seven days.\",\r\n        \"diff\": \"--- policy:v1\\n+++ policy:v2\\n@@ -1 +1 @@\\n-Refund window: thirty days.\\n+Refund window: seven days.\"\r\n      }\r\n    ]\r\n  }\r\n}\r\n"]
[20, "o", "\u001b[2J\u001b[HDocument Change Monitor\r\nBehavior under test\r\n\r\n.                                                                        [100%]\r\n1 passed in 0.13s"]
[30, "o", "\u001b[2J\u001b[HDocument Change Monitor\r\nMeasured evaluation / fixture mode\r\n\r\n{\r\n  \"passed\": true,\r\n  \"scenario\": {\r\n    \"diff\": {\r\n      \"changed\": true,\r\n      \"version\": 2,\r\n      \"diff\": \"--- policy:v1\\n+++ policy:v2\\n@@ -1 +1 @@\\n-Refund window: thirty days.\\n+Refund window: seven days.\"\r\n    },\r\n    \"current\": [\r\n      {\r\n        \"id\": \"policy\",\r\n        \"version\": 2,\r\n        \"text\": \"Refund window: seven days.\",\r\n        \"score\": 1\r\n      }\r\n    ],\r\n    \"old_term_results\": [],\r\n    \"after_retirement\": [],\r\n    \"history\": [\r\n      {\r\n        \"id\": \"policy:1\",\r\n        \"text\": \"Refund window: thirty days.\",\r\n        \"diff\": \"--- policy:v0\\n+++ policy:v1\\n@@ -0,0 +1 @@\\n+Refund window: thirty days.\"\r\n      },\r\n      {\r\n        \"id\": \"policy:2\",\r\n        \"text\": \"Refund window: seven days.\",\r\n        \"diff\": \"--- policy:v1\\n+++ policy:v2\\n@@ -1 +1 @@\\n-Refund window: thirty days.\\n+Refund window: seven days.\"\r\n      }\r\n    ]\r\n  }\r\n}"]
[40, "o", "\u001b[2J\u001b[HDocument Change Monitor\r\nTradeoffs to explain at interview\r\n\r\nThe index is an on-read lexical scan for a tiny corpus, not a vector database. Full documents are kept in memory; large-source streaming is not implemented.\r\n"]
[50, "o", "\u001b[2J\u001b[HDocument Change Monitor\r\nRun it yourself\r\n\r\ngit clone https://github.com/danielpdev/document-change-monitor.git\r\ncd document-change-monitor\r\nmake setup\r\nmake demo\r\nmake test\r\nmake eval\r\n\r\nSee README.md and docs/INTERVIEW_RO.md.\r\n\r\nAI-assisted portfolio project. Synthetic data.\r\nNo production customer claims."]
